## SQ-SG-02 | sheared grass does not spread (also sets up SQ-SG-03; 60 s at randomTickSpeed 300)
@group A
@commands Patches of `minecraft:dirt`; centres `minecraft:grass_block[fertile=false]` and `minecraft:grass_block`
@pass Sheared patch: 24 dirt left, centre still `fertile=false` (`/execute if block ... minecraft:grass_block[fertile=false]`); other patch: fewer than 24
@fails IW behaviour changed: re-read `ModGrassBlock#isRandomlyTicking`
